## Model card

- **Name:** Claude Opus 5
- **Short description:** Anthropic's Opus generation for long autonomous coding; 1M/128K context, succeeded by Opus 5.5. Built for long autonomous coding sessions.
- **Provider / access:** Anthropic anthropic/claude-opus-5. Chat Completions API.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-07-24 release per official news; knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** anthropic/claude-opus-5 — no Free ID on Zen.
- **Context window:** 1M total / 128K max output per meta.json.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, PDF in; text out. Reasoning yes; tool calls supported.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-20):** $5 / $25 per 1M input / output. Paid only.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary.

